{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな暖かくするんだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も沢山の皆さんが\nおめでとうって言ってくださり\nまた一つ思い出と夢ができた日になりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7HMCSEWZAH4X7TWDSJXNT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7HNDE1J4K740G0AKN9F84","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばこのハブちゃん\n首元についてる方を多数発見しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ハブとハブどっちに噛まれたい？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"　　　　　　... なーんて。👁️👁️❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなことばっかり言ってたら\nふーちゃんを土生の女にできなくなっちゃう !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7HPD0MEDFPFHRA388D11Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月末に皆さんに卒業発表してから約3ヶ月\nメンバーみんなに沢山甘えてしまってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7HQDJQRKY103487YZCQDT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7HRBCH8TNCT3Q6MG85D6Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7HS95N8EWMRXMKP4HR5P5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7HT9KJBY149CJY41XZJVW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7HV7H6R26SJGXGSG554SM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなにどんなにアルバムをめくっても\nメンバーとの写真でいっぱいです、\n１枚１枚に思い出があるんだよな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に自分にとって２０２３年１１月は\nとても大きいだろうなと今、感じています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは第74回NHK紅白歌合戦\n櫻坂46が出場させていただけること。\nこの紅白という場で咲く、\nグループの未来の姿を日々応援してくださる\nBuddiesの皆さんと見守ることができる事 ！\n本当に心の底から嬉しかったです ✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなもブログで書いてくれているように\n今年は、本当にチャレンジの1年でした。\n応援してくださる皆さんを大切に。\n私自身も最後の最後の時間まで、櫻坂46\n土生瑞穂として駆け抜けたいと思います ✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切に過ごそう ☺︎ また明日ね ☺︎"}],"source":"archive"}